  ["forever.hunter-beast-mastery.split"] = "how to fill the first ten points. Both full orders take Pathfinding before the tenth point, which row 2 does not allow, so its two points go to Improved Revive Pet and Endurance Training here. Vareion also takes Frenzy to five and no Spirit Bond. The last twenty are the Marksmanship tail, with a second Rapid Killing in place of Lone Wolf.",
  ["forever.hunter-marksmanship.dry"] = "Sniper Shot is a long cast, so cast it while the pet holds the monster.",
  ["forever.hunter-marksmanship.intro"] = "Marksmanship puts the damage in your own shots. Lethal Attacks and Careful Aim come first, Trueshot Aura at 25, and Sniper Shot at 40 is a long, hard opener. Your pet holds threat less well than in Beast Mastery, so the build asks more of you.",
  ["forever.hunter-marksmanship.line"] = "Aimed Shot, Arcane Shot and a long Sniper Shot from range. It hits hard, and the pet holds threat less well.",
  ["forever.hunter-marksmanship.note"] = "(42 points in Marksmanship, then 9 in Beast Mastery for Deadly Aspects, Focused Fire and Improved Revive Pet.)",
  ["forever.hunter-marksmanship.p1"] = "1% more critical strike chance on all your attacks. Every full Marksmanship order starts here, and Careful Aim is next.",
  ["forever.hunter-marksmanship.p10"] = "A long cast that hits hard and lengthens your next three shots by 10 yards. Guides call it your biggest jump, and the opener.",
  ["forever.hunter-marksmanship.p11"] = "The last point of 5% more damage with ranged weapons, taken once Sniper Shot is in.",
  ["forever.hunter-marksmanship.p12"] = "Your shots, stings and melee strikes cost 15% less mana. Every long fight is cheaper.",
  ["forever.hunter-marksmanship.p13"] = "With Aspect of the Hawk on, Auto Shot sometimes speeds up your shooting by 30% for 12 seconds. The Beast Mastery tail starts here.",
  ["forever.hunter-marksmanship.p14"] = "2% more damage for you and your pet while the pet is out.",
  ["forever.hunter-marksmanship.p15"] = "Arcane Shot comes back 1.5 seconds sooner.",
  ["forever.hunter-marksmanship.p16"] = "Revive Pet casts 6 seconds faster and costs 40% less mana. Vareion ends here, and a variant swaps these for Lone Wolf.",
  ["forever.hunter-marksmanship.p2"] = "Your attack power rises by your Intellect, so gear with Intellect pays twice, in mana and in damage. Mortal Shots needs all five points.",
  ["forever.hunter-marksmanship.p3"] = "6 yards more range on your ranged weapons. More range is more time before the monster reaches you.",
  ["forever.hunter-marksmanship.p4"] = "Rapid Fire comes back 2 minutes sooner, and a kill under your Serpent Sting makes your next shot hit 20% harder. Rapid Recuperation needs it.",
  ["forever.hunter-marksmanship.p5"] = "Party members within 45 yards gain 20 ranged attack power. Sniper Shot needs it, and Icy Veins' picture has it.",
  ["forever.hunter-marksmanship.p6"] = "Critical hits with ranged abilities deal 30% more. It needs Careful Aim.",
  ["forever.hunter-marksmanship.p7"] = "A Serpent Sting lets half your mana regeneration go on while you cast. Icy Veins says it solves almost all your mana problems.",
  ["forever.hunter-marksmanship.p8"] = "Multi-Shot, Aimed Shot and Volley deal 15% more damage.",
  ["forever.hunter-marksmanship.p9"] = "5% more damage with ranged weapons. Sniper Shot asks for thirty points in the tree, and these are four of them.",
