  ["forever.mage-arcane.split"] = "how safe it is. Zockify makes Arcane the default and Method says it out-damages Frost when you quest alone, while most guides keep Frost as the safer way. Zockify would start with Wand Specialization, and Mobalytics starts with Improved Channeling. Mobalytics' order is followed here.",
  ["forever.mage-fire.dry"] = "A Pyroblast on a monster that dies before it lands is mana you will want back.",
  ["forever.mage-fire.intro"] = "Fire is crits and burning. Fireball does the work, Ignite makes every crit burn, and Pyroblast is a long cast for a large hit. It has few defences, so it asks you to keep your distance.",
  ["forever.mage-fire.line"] = "Fireball, Ignite and Pyroblast. Hits hard from range, and is harder to solo than Frost.",
  ["forever.mage-fire.note"] = "(31 points in Fire, 3 in Frost, then 17 in Arcane for mana.)",
  ["forever.mage-fire.p1"] = "Fireball casts faster. Fireball is the Fire build's main spell, and a shorter cast means fewer hits taken while you cast it.",
  ["forever.mage-fire.p10"] = "Burns everything around you and slows it. Cast it when a pack closes in, then step away.",
  ["forever.mage-fire.p11"] = "Fire spells crit more often. Combustion needs all three ranks.",
  ["forever.mage-fire.p12"] = "Fire spells reach farther. One point, taken to bring the next row closer.",
  ["forever.mage-fire.p13"] = "Your Fire damage rises for each Fire effect on the target, up to a cap. Ignite's burn and Pyroblast's fire both count.",
  ["forever.mage-fire.p14"] = "The second rank of the extra reach.",
  ["forever.mage-fire.p15"] = "Fire Blast, Ice Lance, Arcane Blast and Scorch crit more often. The Arcane Blast you take at 58 is on that list.",
  ["forever.mage-fire.p16"] = "For a short while each Fire hit raises your Fire crit chance, until you have landed 3 crits. It needs Critical Mass at full.",
  ["forever.mage-fire.p17"] = "Arcane tail, for mana. Five points open Arcane's second row, and your Arcane casts sometimes lose less time when you are hit.",
  ["forever.mage-fire.p18"] = "Fireball sometimes makes your next Arcane Missiles shorter and free. Cast the Missiles when it lights up.",
  ["forever.mage-fire.p19"] = "Your damage spells sometimes make the next spell free. Full ranks are needed before Arcane Meditation.",
  ["forever.mage-fire.p2"] = "Fewer misses on every spell. It sits in Frost, and Mobalytics takes it before Ignite because a resisted Fireball is the dearest miss in the build.",
  ["forever.mage-fire.p20"] = "The second rank of Missile Barrage.",
  ["forever.mage-fire.p21"] = "Your spells are resisted less. A small gain, taken because the points after it are for mana.",
  ["forever.mage-fire.p22"] = "A hard-hitting spell with Incineration's crit bonus behind it. Cast it a few times, not until the bar is gone.",
  ["forever.mage-fire.p23"] = "Part of your mana regeneration continues while you cast. The last points, and the build's answer to running dry.",
  ["forever.mage-fire.p3"] = "Your Fire crits set the target burning for extra damage over a few seconds. Fire lives on crits, and this is what a crit is worth.",
  ["forever.mage-fire.p4"] = "A huge, slow Fire cast. Cast it to open a fight from range, or when Heating Up has made it short. It needs ten points in Fire.",
  ["forever.mage-fire.p5"] = "Your Fire spells often keep casting when you are hit, and they cause less threat. Questing in Fire without this means being interrupted all the time.",
  ["forever.mage-fire.p6"] = "Fire Blast comes back sooner and reaches farther, which means more Heating Up stacks.",
  ["forever.mage-fire.p7"] = "Crits from Fireball, Fire Blast, Frostfire Bolt and Scorch shorten your next Pyroblast, up to 3 stacks, and Fire Blast adds a stack on every hit.",
  ["forever.mage-fire.p8"] = "The second rank of Improved Fire Blast.",
  ["forever.mage-fire.p9"] = "Your Fire and Frost crits give mana back. Fire crits often, so this is the mana talent of the build.",
  ["forever.mage-fire.s1"] = "Before your first talent point. The same kit in every build.",
