  ["forever.rogue-combat.s1.opening2.why"] = "it hits hard and gives you a combo point",
  ["forever.rogue-combat.s2"] = "Slice and Dice, Sprint and Sap arrive at 10, Ambush at 18. Sinister Strike is the strike you press.",
