  ["forever.shaman-elemental.split"] = "how early to take the mana. Tiqqle's second order starts with Tidal Focus, Mindfulness and Water Shield and gives up damage until level 21. The order here is the first one, which waits for Water Shield until 43.",
  ["forever.shaman-enhancement.dry"] = "The weapon matters more than any talent, so keep a slow two-hander in your hand.",
  ["forever.shaman-enhancement.intro"] = "Enhancement fights up close with a weapon, shocks and Stormstrike. Most guides call it the smoothest Shaman to level. Mana is its trouble before 30, so the first talents are about mana and Stormstrike.",
  ["forever.shaman-enhancement.line"] = "Stormstrike, shocks and a weapon imbue, up close. The smoothest Shaman to level, once Stormstrike is yours at 25.",
  ["forever.shaman-enhancement.note"] = "(34 points in Enhancement, 11 in Restoration for mana, 6 in Elemental.)",
  ["forever.shaman-enhancement.p1"] = "A point is 1% more critical strikes on every attack and spell. It is the only talent on that row that helps a fighter on every swing.",
  ["forever.shaman-enhancement.p10"] = "Stormstrike can give you mana regeneration while you cast, and a dodge or a parry can reset its cooldown. It keeps you fighting.",
  ["forever.shaman-enhancement.p11"] = "You can parry, and a parry can reset Stormstrike. It also makes less threat while Rockbiter Weapon is off, which a group likes.",
  ["forever.shaman-enhancement.p12"] = "Healing costs 5% less and you hit 5% more often. The hit helps a fighter too, and these points open Mindfulness and Water Shield.",
  ["forever.shaman-enhancement.p13"] = "Some of your mana regeneration keeps going while you cast. Mana is what stops a shaman, so it is worth a detour out of your tree.",
  ["forever.shaman-enhancement.p14"] = "Totems cost less mana. It is the least bad pick on its row, and Water Shield asks for ten points in the tree.",
  ["forever.shaman-enhancement.p15"] = "Globes of water give back mana when you are hit or land a critical strike. You give up Lightning Shield for it, since only one shield holds.",
  ["forever.shaman-enhancement.p16"] = "A third point of attack speed after a critical strike.",
  ["forever.shaman-enhancement.p17"] = "Adds spell damage from your Intellect. It is small for you, but Rage of the Farseer asks for it.",
  ["forever.shaman-enhancement.p18"] = "Melee hits can stack a quicker, cheaper Lightning Bolt up to 5 times. Cast the bolt at 5 stacks.",
  ["forever.shaman-enhancement.p19"] = "Your own small bloodlust: 30% attack speed for 25 seconds, on a long cooldown. Press it on a hard pull.",
  ["forever.shaman-enhancement.p2"] = "Turns your Intellect into attack power, and Intellect is also your mana. Gear with it pays twice. Flurry needs it.",
  ["forever.shaman-enhancement.p20"] = "Attack speed after a critical strike, at its full strength.",
  ["forever.shaman-enhancement.p21"] = "More damage on Lightning Bolt, Chain Lightning and Earth Shock. It is the only damage left that fits.",
  ["forever.shaman-enhancement.p22"] = "A critical spell hit raises your melee critical chance for a short while, so your bolts and shocks feed Flurry.",
  ["forever.shaman-enhancement.p3"] = "Intellect is a bigger mana pool and now attack power too. These two points open the third row, and nothing on row 2 helps you more.",
  ["forever.shaman-enhancement.p4"] = "Shocks and Lightning Shield cost 45% less mana. Mana is what stops you, and Earth Shock is a button you press all the time.",
  ["forever.shaman-enhancement.p5"] = "Your weapon imbues hit harder: Rockbiter and Windfury Weapon give more, Flametongue does more damage.",
  ["forever.shaman-enhancement.p6"] = "One point to open the next row, and a little dodge. Ancestral Knowledge works as well if you would sooner have mana.",
  ["forever.shaman-enhancement.p7"] = "Your main button. A weapon strike on a short cooldown that makes your next Lightning Bolt, Chain Lightning or Earth Shock hit harder.",
  ["forever.shaman-enhancement.p8"] = "Ghost Wolf becomes instant and works indoors. From level 20 it is how you cross the world.",
  ["forever.shaman-enhancement.p9"] = "More attack speed after a critical strike. It needs Mental Dexterity, and it opens the row that holds Improved Stormstrike.",
  ["forever.shaman-enhancement.s1"] = "Before your first talent point. The same kit in every build.",
