  ["forever.shaman-enhancement.split"] = "mana against speed. Icy Veins would start in Restoration for Mindfulness and Water Shield and respec at 25. Nicktew calls that a mistake, because Stormstrike should come as early as it can. The order here is Nicktew's, with Mindfulness and Water Shield after Improved Stormstrike.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.dry"] = "A heal that lands early beats a bigger heal that lands late.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.intro"] = "Restoration heals a group with Healing Wave, Riptide and Chain Heal, and fills the gaps with totems. It is for dungeons and for playing with a friend. Alone it is the slowest way to level.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.line"] = "Healing Wave, Riptide and Chain Heal, with totems. A healer for a group, slow alone.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.note"] = "(46 points in Restoration, 5 in Enhancement for Intellect.)",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p1"] = "Healing Wave casts faster. It is the heal you cast most, and a quicker cast lands before the damage does.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p10"] = "Your next Nature spell, Healing Wave among them, becomes instant. It is the emergency button.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p11"] = "Healing Wave heals for much more. It is the spell you cast most, and Riptide needs this talent.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p12"] = "A critical heal gives your target more armour for a while. It is the last point of a row you had to pass.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p13"] = "Every healing spell heals 10% more. It is the biggest plain gain on the tree.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p14"] = "A heal over time that makes Chain Heal stronger on the same target. Put it on the hurt, then Chain Heal them.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p15"] = "Your healing spells crit more often, and a crit gives back mana through Water Shield.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p16"] = "Totems cost less mana at full ranks. You drop several in a dungeon.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p17"] = "Mana Spring Totem and Healing Stream Totem work 5% better a point. It helps the whole group.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p18"] = "Intellect: more mana to heal with, and more spell critical chance. Nothing left in Restoration helps you more.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p2"] = "Some of your mana regeneration keeps going while you cast. A healer casts all the time, so this keeps you healing.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p3"] = "Healing costs 5% less at full ranks, and spells hit more often. These points lead to Water Shield.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p4"] = "Globes of water give back mana when you are hit or land a critical strike. Only one shield holds, so it replaces Lightning Shield.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p5"] = "Tidal Focus at full strength: healing costs 5% less and you hit more often with spells.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p6"] = "A critical heal gives your target more armour for a while. One point opens the way to Mana Tide Totem.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p7"] = "Mana Tide Totem gives your whole group mana back, on a long cooldown. Press it when the group runs low.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p8"] = "Being hit while you cast has a good chance of not slowing your heals. Fewer ruined casts.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p9"] = "A critical heal gives your target more armour for a while. It takes the points Nature's Swiftness asks for.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s1"] = "Before your first talent point. The same kit in every build.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s1.between1.if"] = "after a fight, if you are hurt",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s1.between1.why"] = "it heals a lot for its mana",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s1.between2.if"] = "after a fight, before the next pull",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s1.between2.text"] = "Sit and drink",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s1.between2.why"] = "mana from drinking is cheap, and a pull on empty is not",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s1.loop1.if"] = "whenever it is ready",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s1.loop1.why"] = "it hits hard and stops a cast",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s1.loop2.if"] = "if the monster is still far",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s1.loop2.why"] = "a bolt lands before the monster does",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s1.loop3.why"] = "a swing costs no mana",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s1.low1.if"] = "when your mana is nearly gone",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s1.low1.why"] = "a swing costs no mana, and mana returns while you swing",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s1.opening1.if"] = "if it has worn off",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s1.opening1.why"] = "it adds attack power to every swing",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s1.opening2.if"] = "before the first pull",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s1.opening2.why"] = "its orbs hurt whatever hits you",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s1.opening3.if"] = "from as far away as it reaches",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s1.opening3.why"] = "the pull costs little and the monster walks to you",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s2"] = "Healing Wave is your spell, and Improved Healing Wave makes it quicker. In a group, start it before the hit lands. Alone, keep the weapon and the totem working and heal between monsters.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s2.between1.if"] = "after a fight, if you are hurt",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s2.between1.why"] = "it heals a lot for its mana",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s2.between2.if"] = "after a fight, before the next pull",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s2.between2.text"] = "Sit and drink",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s2.between2.why"] = "mana from drinking is cheap, and a pull on empty is not",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s2.loop1.if"] = "on whoever is hurt worst",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s2.loop1.why"] = "it is your efficient heal",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s2.loop2.if"] = "against a dangerous cast",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s2.loop2.why"] = "it stops the cast before you must heal it",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s2.loop3.if"] = "when nobody needs a heal",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s2.loop3.why"] = "it adds damage for little mana",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s2.loop4.why"] = "damage from range while the group is healthy",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s2.low1.if"] = "when your mana is nearly gone",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s2.low1.why"] = "a swing costs no mana, and mana returns while you swing",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s2.opening1.if"] = "between pulls",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s2.opening1.why"] = "its orbs hurt whatever hits you",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s2.opening2.if"] = "if it has worn off",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s2.opening2.why"] = "it adds attack power to every swing",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s2.opening3.if"] = "on the tank, before the pull",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s2.opening3.why"] = "a heal that lands early beats a bigger one that lands late",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s3"] = "Water Shield at 20 and Mana Tide Totem at 25 are your mana. Lesser Healing Wave is the quick heal, and Nature's Swiftness at 30 is the emergency. Agree the drink breaks before a hard pull.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s3.between1.if"] = "after a fight, before the next pull",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s3.between1.text"] = "Sit and drink",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s3.between1.why"] = "mana from drinking is cheap, and a pull on empty is not",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s3.between2.if"] = "when you leave your totems behind",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s3.between2.why"] = "it gives back part of their mana",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s3.big"] = "Swiftness for an emergency heal, Mana Tide when the group runs low",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s3.loop1.if"] = "when a big hit would land too late",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s3.loop1.why"] = "it is quicker than Healing Wave but heals less for its mana",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s3.loop2.if"] = "on whoever is hurt worst",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s3.loop2.why"] = "it is your efficient heal",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s3.loop3.if"] = "against a dangerous cast",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s3.loop3.why"] = "it stops the cast before you must heal it",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s3.loop4.if"] = "against three or more, if nobody is hurt",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s3.loop4.why"] = "it adds damage for little mana",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s3.loop5.why"] = "damage from range while the group is healthy",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s3.low1.if"] = "when the group is low on mana",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s3.low1.why"] = "it gives the whole group mana back",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s3.opening1.if"] = "if you took it, before each pull",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s3.opening1.why"] = "it gives back mana when you are hit or crit",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s3.opening2.if"] = "if you did not take Water Shield",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s3.opening2.why"] = "its orbs hurt whatever hits you",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s3.opening3.if"] = "when your group needs the mana",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s3.opening3.why"] = "it gives mana back to you and your party",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s3.opening4.if"] = "on the tank, before the pull",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s3.opening4.why"] = "a heal that lands early beats a bigger one that lands late",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s3.rarely1.if"] = "when a fear is coming",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s3.rarely1.why"] = "it breaks fear, charm and sleep",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s3.rarely2.if"] = "for steady light damage",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s3.rarely2.why"] = "it heals a little all the time",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s3.rarely3.if"] = "to travel, out of a fight",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s3.rarely3.why"] = "it is faster than walking, and you cannot cast in it",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s4"] = "Riptide and Chain Heal at 40 are your group healing: put Riptide on the hurt, then Chain Heal that target. Healing Way and Purification make every heal count. Keep your group close so Chain Heal can jump.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s4.between1.if"] = "after a fight, before the next pull",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s4.between1.text"] = "Sit and drink",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s4.between1.why"] = "mana from drinking is cheap, and a pull on empty is not",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s4.between2.if"] = "when you leave your totems behind",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s4.between2.why"] = "it gives back part of their mana",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s4.big"] = "Swiftness for an emergency heal, Mana Tide when the group runs low",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s4.loop1.if"] = "on a hurt ally who does not have it",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s4.loop1.why"] = "it heals over time and powers up Chain Heal",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s4.loop2.if"] = "when two or more are hurt",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s4.loop2.why"] = "it jumps on, and hits harder on a Riptide target",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s4.loop3.if"] = "when a big hit would land too late",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s4.loop3.why"] = "it is quicker than Healing Wave but heals less for its mana",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s4.loop4.if"] = "on whoever is hurt worst",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s4.loop4.why"] = "it is your efficient heal",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s4.loop5.if"] = "against a dangerous cast",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s4.loop5.why"] = "it stops the cast before you must heal it",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s4.loop6.why"] = "damage from range while the group is healthy",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s4.low1.if"] = "when the group is low on mana",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s4.low1.why"] = "it gives the whole group mana back",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s4.opening1.if"] = "if you took it, before each pull",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s4.opening1.why"] = "it gives back mana when you are hit or crit",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s4.opening2.if"] = "if you did not take Water Shield",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s4.opening2.why"] = "its orbs hurt whatever hits you",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s4.opening3.if"] = "when your group needs the mana",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s4.opening3.why"] = "it gives mana back to you and your party",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s4.opening4.if"] = "on the tank, before the pull",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s4.opening4.why"] = "it heals over time and powers up Chain Heal",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s4.rarely1.if"] = "when a fear is coming",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s4.rarely1.why"] = "it breaks fear, charm and sleep",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s4.rarely2.if"] = "for steady light damage",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s4.rarely2.why"] = "it heals a little all the time",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s4.rarely3.if"] = "against three or more, if nobody is hurt",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s4.rarely3.why"] = "it adds damage for little mana",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.split"] = "when to take the mana talents. Devil's order, the newest, takes Mindfulness at 15 and Water Shield at 20. Tiqqle and Nicktew take them later in their damage orders. The order here is Devil's.",
  ["forever.shaman.advice.damage"] = "Enhancement is the build this page advises, because it is the smoothest to level and its Stormstrike comes at 25. The price: you fight up close and your mana is thin until 30. Elemental stays at range with bolts and shocks, and it is slower alone because you drink more.",
  ["forever.shaman.advice.heal"] = "Restoration is the healer. It is the right pick for dungeons and for playing with a friend. Alone it is the slowest way to level, and a damage build with a good weapon is quicker.",
  ["forever.shaman.ov.bad"] = "Mana. A long fight runs you dry, a pack can overwhelm you, and your best talents come late. Totems cost mana too, so drop only what the fight needs.",
  ["forever.shaman.ov.good"] = "Doing a bit of everything. You can fight up close or from range, heal yourself or a friend, interrupt a cast with Earth Shock and cross the world as a wolf from 20.",
  ["forever.shaman.ov.levelling"] = "Imbue your weapon, drop the Fire totem and open with a shock. Keep Earth Shock for casters, heal after the fight and drink before the next. Enhancement is the quickest to level, and Elemental and Restoration are slower alone.",
  ["forever.shaman.ov.resource"] = "Mana. It returns slowly after five seconds of not casting, so finish a nearly dead monster with the weapon. Mindfulness, Water Shield and Improved Stormstrike let it return while you fight.",
  ["forever.shaman.ov.ten"] = "You get your first talent point and pick a spec. Enhancement is the smoothest to level, Elemental stays at range and Restoration heals a group. Your Fire totem quest is at 10 too, and a respec costs gold.",
  ["forever.shaman.ov.who"] = "You drop totems, imbue your weapon, shock what stands in front of you and heal yourself when it hurts. The craft is mana: nearly everything you do costs it, and the rest of the class is ways to get it back.",
  ["forever.shaman.role.damage"] = "Most guides level Enhancement. Stormstrike comes at 25, Windfury Weapon at 30, and it needs less drinking than Elemental.",
  ["forever.shaman.role.heal"] = "The healer for dungeons and for playing with a friend. Riptide and Chain Heal come at 40, and Water Shield at 20 carries your mana.",
  ["forever.warlock"] = "Mana and health are both your money. Life Tap turns one into the other, and Drain Life turns a monster's health into yours. Shadow Bolt and Immolate are yours from the start, Corruption comes at 4, Bane of Agony and Fear at 8. A demon from a class quest fights beside you, and every line below says what it should be doing.",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.dry"] = "Drain Life is weak until your thirties, so keep the wand in your hand until then.",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.intro"] = "Affliction puts damage over time on a monster and heals you from the drain. A demon holds one monster while you work on the other. Most guides call it the fastest way to level a Warlock.",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.line"] = "Bane of Agony, Corruption and Drain Life, with a demon holding the monster. The fastest way to level, and busy.",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.note"] = "(41 points in Affliction, then 10 in Demonology for the demon.)",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.p1"] = "Corruption becomes instant at full ranks, so you cast it as you walk and put it on a second monster. It is the spell you cast most.",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.p10"] = "The last rank of the bigger crits. Corruption and Bane of Agony crit often enough that you feel it.",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.p11"] = "Your demon hits harder. A Warlock fights two monsters at once by letting the demon do the work on one of them.",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.p12"] = "Your demon heals from the damage you deal and gets mana back when you Life Tap. It stays alive and keeps fighting.",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.p13"] = "More crits on your Shadow spells. Pandemic makes each crit hit much harder, so the two work as a pair.",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.p14"] = "More health and mana for your demon, and more mana for you. The demon lives longer, and you have more mana to spend.",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.p15"] = "Bane of Agony hurts a little more. You cast it on every monster, so a small rise adds up.",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.p16"] = "A monster that dies while you drain its soul brings your mana back faster for a short while. Finish a kill with Drain Soul.",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.p17"] = "A damage over time spell that heals you. It pays on a monster that lives for a few ticks, and not on one about to die.",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.p2"] = "Fewer missed spells and less threat on you. A missed damage over time spell is mana gone for nothing, so this comes before the damage talents.",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.p3"] = "Your Affliction spells reach further, so you open from farther away and your demon has time to take the monster first.",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.p4"] = "Drain Life hurts and heals more. The build leans on it: the monster hits you, and you take the health back.",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.p5"] = "Corruption and Drain Life ticks can make your next Shadow Bolt instant. Spend it at once, on the monster with the most health left.",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.p6"] = "A hit mostly no longer pushes back your Drain Life. Without it a monster in melee ruins the drain you took it for.",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.p7"] = "Your drains hit and heal harder for every other Affliction effect on the target. Put Bane of Agony and Corruption on first, then drain.",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.p8"] = "When your damage over time spells and drains crit, they crit much harder. It pays most with Malevolence and Shadow Mastery behind it.",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.p9"] = "All your Shadow damage and drained life rises. Nearly everything you cast is Shadow, so it counts on every pull.",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s1"] = "Before your first talent point. The same kit in every build.",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s1.between1.if"] = "after a fight, if your health is high",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s1.between1.why"] = "it turns spare health into the mana you need",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s1.between2.if"] = "after a fight, before the next pull",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s1.between2.text"] = "Sit and drink",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s1.between2.why"] = "mana from drinking is cheap, and a pull on empty is not",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s1.loop1.if"] = "on a monster that will live a while",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s1.loop1.why"] = "it hurts most at the end, so cast it early",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s1.loop2.if"] = "when it is not on the monster",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s1.loop2.why"] = "it ticks while you do something else",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s1.loop3.if"] = "when it is not on the monster",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s1.loop3.why"] = "it burns while you do something else",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s1.loop4.if"] = "when a second monster joins",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s1.loop4.why"] = "it runs off and stops hitting you",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s1.loop5.why"] = "the plain hit, for when nothing else is worth the mana",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s1.low1.if"] = "when your mana is nearly gone",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s1.low1.why"] = "the wand costs no mana, and your damage keeps ticking",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s1.opening1.if"] = "when it is not out",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s1.opening1.why"] = "it fights for you while you cast",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s1.opening2.if"] = "before the first pull",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s1.opening2.why"] = "it raises your armour and health regeneration",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s1.opening3.if"] = "from as far away as it reaches",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s1.opening3.why"] = "it burns while the monster walks to you",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2"] = "Your Voidwalker quest is at 10. Corruption is instant at 14. Bane of Agony first, so the demon takes the monster, then Corruption, Immolate, and the wand.",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2.between1.if"] = "after a fight, if your health is high",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2.between1.why"] = "it turns spare health into the mana you need",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2.between2.if"] = "after a fight, before the next pull",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2.between2.text"] = "Sit and drink",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2.between2.why"] = "mana from drinking is cheap, and a pull on empty is not",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2.between3.if"] = "when you have none",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2.between3.why"] = "it heals you, in a fight too, and costs a shard",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2.loop1.if"] = "when it is not on the monster",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2.loop1.why"] = "it ticks while you do something else",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2.loop2.if"] = "if the monster will live to burn",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2.loop2.why"] = "it needs time to pay back its mana",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2.loop3.if"] = "when you need health",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2.loop3.why"] = "it takes the monster's health into yours",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2.loop4.why"] = "the wand costs no mana, and your damage keeps ticking",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2.low1.if"] = "when mana is low and health is high",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2.low1.why"] = "it turns health into mana, and a drain gives it back",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2.low2.if"] = "when your mana is nearly gone",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2.low2.why"] = "the wand costs no mana, and your damage keeps ticking",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2.opening1.if"] = "when it is not out",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2.opening1.why"] = "it holds a monster while you cast",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2.opening2.if"] = "before the first pull",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2.opening2.why"] = "it raises your armour and health regeneration",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2.opening3.if"] = "first, on the monster your demon holds",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2.opening3.why"] = "it starts slowly, so your demon takes the monster first",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2.rarely1.if"] = "when a second monster joins",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2.rarely1.why"] = "it runs off and stops hitting you",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2.rarely2.if"] = "when a monster turns on you",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2.rarely2.text"] = "Torment",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2.rarely2.why"] = "your Voidwalker takes it back",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2.rarely3.if"] = "when your health is low",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2.rarely3.text"] = "Sacrifice",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2.rarely3.why"] = "the Voidwalker dies and shields you",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2.rarely4.if"] = "to finish a monster, if you need a shard",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s2.rarely4.why"] = "a monster killed under it always gives a shard",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s3"] = "The Succubus at 20 hits harder than the Voidwalker. Let your demon go in, put your damage over time on, and drain the monster when it reaches you. Fel Concentration by 29 keeps the drain going.",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s3.between1.if"] = "after a fight, if your health is high",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s3.between1.why"] = "it turns spare health into the mana you need",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s3.between2.if"] = "after a fight, before the next pull",
  ["forever.warlock-affliction.s3.between2.text"] = "Sit and drink",
